{
    "title": "Bullet Echo",
    "description": "Like action shooters? Bullet Echo is an exciting PvP tactical top-down shooter. Use stealth, team up, and shoot to win in this shooting game with multiplayer!\r\n\r\nChoose from dozens of different heroes with unique play styles, guns and abilities.\r\nUnite with friends, set a strategy, and be the last team standing when the battle ends!\r\n\r\n- UNIQUE TACTICAL STEALTH ACTION: Your vision is limited by the beam of a flashlight, but you can hear enemies' steps and shots.\r\n- DESIGNED FOR TEAM PLAY: Start playing with friends online right away! The level of your hero is matched with the highest level in the party.\r\n- MULTIPLE GAME MODES: Team vs Team, Solo and Battle Royale mode with 5 small teams on one map.\r\n- UNLOCK AND UPGRADE NEW HEROES: Each hero has a unique set of abilities. Rank up to boost your hero's power and unlock new iguns perks.\r\n- BE ON TOP: Participate in championships, accomplish missions, and receive valuable resources, mastering the art of CQB and precise bullet control.\r\n- GET REWARDS: Fight to unlock new heroes with unique guns, new perks, maps and game modes!\r\n\r\nFrom the creators of C.A.T.S.: Crash Arena Turbo Stars, King of Thieves and Cut the Rope.\r\n\r\nJoin our official Discord server to connect with other players and share your Bullet Echo tactics: https://discord.gg/u4ApPB7",
    "descriptionHTML": "Like action shooters? Bullet Echo is an exciting PvP tactical top-down shooter. Use stealth, team up, and shoot to win in this shooting game with multiplayer!<br><br>Choose from dozens of different heroes with unique play styles, guns and abilities.<br>Unite with friends, set a strategy, and be the last team standing when the battle ends!<br><br>- UNIQUE TACTICAL STEALTH ACTION: Your vision is limited by the beam of a flashlight, but you can hear enemies&#39; steps and shots.<br>- DESIGNED FOR TEAM PLAY: Start playing with friends online right away! The level of your hero is matched with the highest level in the party.<br>- MULTIPLE GAME MODES: Team vs Team, Solo and Battle Royale mode with 5 small teams on one map.<br>- UNLOCK AND UPGRADE NEW HEROES: Each hero has a unique set of abilities. Rank up to boost your hero&#39;s power and unlock new iguns perks.<br>- BE ON TOP: Participate in championships, accomplish missions, and receive valuable resources, mastering the art of CQB and precise bullet control.<br>- GET REWARDS: Fight to unlock new heroes with unique guns, new perks, maps and game modes!<br><br>From the creators of C.A.T.S.: Crash Arena Turbo Stars, King of Thieves and Cut the Rope.<br><br>Join our official Discord server to connect with other players and share your Bullet Echo tactics: https://discord.gg/u4ApPB7",
